  DEC_RW -->|yes / true| SET_UPD
  DEC_RW -->|no / false| SET_RWERR
  SET_UPD -->|repeat| LOOP_CHECK
  SET_RWERR -->|repeat| LOOP_CHECK
  PARA_3000 --> TERMINAL

